<div id="p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<br class="ltx_break ltx_centering">
</div>
<div id="p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="p3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:144%;">Supplementary Material 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></p>
</div>
<section id="S8" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">8 </span>Hyperparameters Optimization</h2>

<div id="S8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The hyperparameters of GB and MLP variants of the detector are finetuned using Grid Search on a selected set of parameters. The training dataset is split into a train and validation set with a 10% allocation for the validation set. The models are finetuned to improve the F1-score on the validation set.</p>
</div>
<div id="S8.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S8.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">GB Optimization</span>: The optimal value of the number of estimators, learning rate (LR) and maximum depth parameters are chosen from the set {100, 200, 300}, {0.1, 0.05, 0.01}, and {3, 5, 10} respectively. The performance of the model under different hyperparameter combinations is shown in <a href="#S8.T5" title="In 8 Hyperparameters Optimization ‣ verthinking Causes Hallucination:Tracing Confounder Propagation in Vision Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S8.T5" class="ltx_table">
<table id="S8.T5.3" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S8.T5.3.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S8.T5.3.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="S8.T5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LR</span></th>
<th id="S8.T5.3.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="S8.T5.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Maximum depth</span></th>
<th id="S8.T5.3.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="S8.T5.3.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">No. of estimators</span></th>
<th id="S8.T5.3.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S8.T5.3.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">F1 (%)</span></th></tr>
</thead>
