</figure>
<div id="S8.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S8.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MLP Optimization</span>: The optimal value of hidden units, learning rate (LR) and optimizers are chosen from the set {32, 64, 128}, {0.1, 0.01, 0.001}, and {Adam, SGD} respectively. The performance of the model on validation set under different hyperparameter combinations is shown in <a href="#S8.T6" title="In 8 Hyperparameters Optimization ‣ verthinking Causes Hallucination:Tracing Confounder Propagation in Vision Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
